    {"id":"artifact-note","type":"rectangle","x":1450,"y":540,"width":980,"height":420,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"#fff9db","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"c20","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":38,"version":1,"versionNonce":38,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},
    {"id":"artifact-note-text","type":"text","x":1475,"y":562,"width":900,"height":300,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#5f3dc4","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"c21","roundness":null,"seed":39,"version":1,"versionNonce":39,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Artifact module note\n\nartifacts/registration.py registers the built-in strategies. ArtifactResolver only stores strategies and delegates to the first can_resolve() match.\n\nThis is OCP + Strategy: add a new strategy class, then add one resolver.register(...) line. The resolver and orchestrator do not change.\n\nThe ordered list is aggregation / weak has-a: strategies are created outside the resolver and can exist independently. ResolvedArtifact is returned for one request, so it is dependency / uses-a.","rawText":"Artifact module note\n\nartifacts/registration.py registers the built-in strategies. ArtifactResolver only stores strategies and delegates to the first can_resolve() match.\n\nThis is OCP + Strategy: add a new strategy class, then add one resolver.register(...) line. The resolver and orchestrator do not change.\n\nThe ordered list is aggregation / weak has-a: strategies are created outside the resolver and can exist independently. ResolvedArtifact is returned for one request, so it is dependency / uses-a.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Artifact module note\n\nartifacts/registration.py registers the built-in strategies. ArtifactResolver only stores strategies and delegates to the first can_resolve() match.\n\nThis is OCP + Strategy: add a new strategy class, then add one resolver.register(...) line. The resolver and orchestrator do not change.\n\nThe ordered list is aggregation / weak has-a: strategies are created outside the resolver and can exist independently. ResolvedArtifact is returned for one request, so it is dependency / uses-a.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},

