    {"id":"prompt-note","type":"rectangle","x":1450,"y":1560,"width":980,"height":260,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#f08c00","backgroundColor":"#fff9db","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"e13","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":80,"version":1,"versionNonce":80,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},
    {"id":"prompt-note-text","type":"text","x":1475,"y":1582,"width":900,"height":190,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#5f3dc4","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"e14","roundness":null,"seed":81,"version":1,"versionNonce":81,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Prompt module note\n\nPromptBuilder turns ResolvedArtifact into the first Prompt. RepairPromptBuilder reuses the original Prompt and adds validation feedback for a retry.\n\nPrompt contains a list of PromptMessage objects. This is composition: messages are the internal parts of the prompt. The repair flow is lightweight prototype-style reuse, while keeping the original prompt unchanged.","rawText":"Prompt module note\n\nPromptBuilder turns ResolvedArtifact into the first Prompt. RepairPromptBuilder reuses the original Prompt and adds validation feedback for a retry.\n\nPrompt contains a list of PromptMessage objects. This is composition: messages are the internal parts of the prompt. The repair flow is lightweight prototype-style reuse, while keeping the original prompt unchanged.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Prompt module note\n\nPromptBuilder turns ResolvedArtifact into the first Prompt. RepairPromptBuilder reuses the original Prompt and adds validation feedback for a retry.\n\nPrompt contains a list of PromptMessage objects. This is composition: messages are the internal parts of the prompt. The repair flow is lightweight prototype-style reuse, while keeping the original prompt unchanged.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},

